Workstation profile — keyboard defaults plus optional FVWM startup integration.

The home/ tree is installed into the target user's home directory. The profile
adds a separate FVWM function and a role-based application launcher; it does not
replace the user's main FVWM configuration. After applying, add this line to
your existing StartFunction:

  + I Function DesktopProfileStartup

The launcher reads ~/.config/devuan-machine-config/apps.conf. It only launches
one executable per role (no shell evaluation or arbitrary command-line parsing).
Review the mappings and installed applications before using the profile.
